# What NOT to upload to EAS Build.
#
# Without this the archive was 183 MB, nearly all of it generated native
# projects and build output that EAS regenerates from app.json anyway. A
# smaller archive is a faster upload and one less thing that can go stale.

# Generated by prebuild — EAS runs its own, and shipping ours means shipping
# whatever local state it had.
/ios
/android

# Build output and caches
.expo/
dist/
web-build/
**/build/
**/.gradle/
**/Pods/

# Nothing here runs on a build server
**/__tests__/
*.test.ts
*.test.tsx
coverage/

# Local only
.env.local
*.log
